# Prettier also reads the root .gitignore, so build output, caches and test artifacts
# (dist, .turbo, .astro, coverage, .vitest) are already skipped. Listed here: files that
# are committed but must not be reformatted.
pnpm-lock.yaml
CHANGELOG.md

# Generated brand stylesheets are committed so a change to createBrand() shows up
# as a diff. Formatting them would make that diff noise rather than signal.
apps/*/src/generated
